  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734014",
      "title": "The useRouteLoaderData() Hook & Accessing Data From Other Routes",
      "sourceHash": "ad77134cb9f734cd2de4c38de04f201c4efd6ea9b674bad61abf395661812f02",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "Now before we start looking at adding events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "and sending data, there is one last aspect of loading data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "which I wanna touch on here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 15.18,
          "en": "When viewing the details of an event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.18,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "we can click this Edit button here at the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 21.75,
          "en": "And this button or this link should take us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 24.57,
          "en": "to the added Edit Event page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "Now for this to happen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 29.602,
          "en": "I first of all have to go to the Event Item js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.602,
          "end": 33.03,
          "en": "and here we wanna use the link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.03,
          "end": 35.261,
          "en": "provided by React Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.261,
          "end": 38.441,
          "en": "So we have to import that and use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.441,
          "end": 41.081,
          "en": "that instead of this anchor element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.081,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "And then I want to add edit and append that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 47.85,
          "en": "to the currently active route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.85,
          "end": 50.463,
          "en": "And of course, this should be to instead of ref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.87,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "With that, if we do that and click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.553,
          "en": "we're taken to that Edit Event Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "Now on this Edit Event Page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 63.999,
          "en": "I want to show this Event Form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.999,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "Now we'll tweak that form a little bit later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 68.61,
          "en": "but for a start I wanna show it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.61,
          "end": 71.64,
          "en": "and therefore here on Edit Event Page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.64,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "I will output this Event Form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "And this Event form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.13,
          "en": "of course also must be Imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.13,
          "end": 85.13,
          "en": "Import event form from components event form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "So that shows us this event form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "Of course, that event form should be prepopulated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 95.743,
          "en": "with the data for the event which we're trying to edit here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.743,
          "end": 100.2,
          "en": "Now to do that, we need to fetch that event detailed data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.2,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "not just on the event detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "but also here on the edit event page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 109.02000000000001,
          "en": "because that's where we need the data for the event form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.02000000000001,
          "end": 112.83,
          "en": "So in this edit event page, we need to fetch the same data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.83,
          "end": 116.16,
          "en": "as we fetch here on the event detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 118.62299999999999,
          "en": "These are two different route definitions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.62299999999999,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "event detail versus added event page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 125.358,
          "en": "and therefore two separate loaders would be needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.358,
          "end": 128.277,
          "en": "But actually thankfully we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.277,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "to repeat our code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 133.039,
          "en": "Instead we can add a new route definition here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.039,
          "end": 136.82999999999998,
          "en": "where we set the path to colon event id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 138.976,
          "en": "So the same path as we have it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.976,
          "end": 141.69,
          "en": "however this will be a route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.69,
          "end": 143.823,
          "en": "that does not render an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.823,
          "end": 145.95,
          "en": "I will not add element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.95,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "Instead I just add children and the children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.55,
          "end": 154.55,
          "en": "of this route will be this route where I now set the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 160.44299999999998,
          "en": "to an empty string or better I simply set index to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.31,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "And this route here where I remove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 167.001,
          "en": "this dynamic path segment at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.001,
          "end": 171.84,
          "en": "This is also how you can use nested routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.84,
          "end": 173.97,
          "en": "to construct a URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 178.44,
          "en": "with the parent route URL and the child route URLs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.44,
          "end": 180.3,
          "en": "Now here we don't have element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.3,
          "end": 183.27,
          "en": "because I don't want to have any shared layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.27,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 186.39,
          "en": "Instead, I'm using this approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.39,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "because I want to add a loader here to this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "This event detail loader, I remove it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 195.21,
          "en": "from the event detail page route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 198.3,
          "en": "and add it to this wrapper route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 201.75,
          "en": "So you can also use this nested routes feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.75,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "not just to use a wrapper layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 210.04,
          "en": "but also to use a shared loader for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.04,
          "end": 213.38,
          "en": "Because as you learned before, you can access loader data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.38,
          "end": 218.38,
          "en": "with use loader data with this special hook provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 221.49,
          "en": "by a React router in any component that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.49,
          "end": 224.28,
          "en": "on the same level or a lower level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 227.15800000000002,
          "en": "than the route where the loader is added to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.15800000000002,
          "end": 229.937,
          "en": "So with that, this loader will execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.937,
          "end": 234.45,
          "en": "whenever we visit this or this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.45,
          "end": 237.27,
          "en": "And that of course then allows us to reuse the logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.27,
          "end": 241.413,
          "en": "and data of that loader in both these routes down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "So therefore now in edit event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 249.03,
          "en": "we can also use the use loader data hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 254.03,
          "en": "which we must import from React-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255.09,
          "end": 260.09,
          "en": "So here I import use loader data and that gives us access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.4,
          "end": 263.43,
          "en": "to the data object, which as we learned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.43,
          "end": 268.097,
          "en": "includes the event which we need under the event property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 268.097,
          "end": 271.86,
          "en": "And now we could pass the event to the event form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 276.86,
          "en": "like this or just like this and omit this step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 279.15,
          "en": "And in event form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.15,
          "end": 280.56,
          "en": "we can now use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.56,
          "end": 283.05,
          "en": "Here we can accept such event prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 283.05,
          "end": 285.998,
          "en": "I actually already added the code for doing so here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 285.998,
          "end": 288.75,
          "en": "I'm extracting this event prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 288.75,
          "end": 292.77,
          "en": "with object destructuring from my props object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 292.77,
          "end": 295.26,
          "en": "And then we can use this event value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.26,
          "end": 298.439,
          "en": "to set some default values on these inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.439,
          "end": 303.439,
          "en": "with the default value attribute provided by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.51,
          "end": 307.083,
          "en": "This allows us to set the default event title for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 307.95,
          "end": 309.24,
          "en": "We just want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 309.24,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "whether we have an event before trying to access it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "So here I check if I have an event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 318.66,
          "en": "If yes, I populate this input with the title of this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.66,
          "end": 321.39300000000003,
          "en": "Otherwise I set this to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.74,
          "end": 327.49,
          "en": "And then I repeat this here for this image input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 328.38,
          "end": 332.85,
          "en": "and also for my date input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 332.85,
          "end": 336.78,
          "en": "And then also for the text area where I set this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 336.78,
          "end": 338.913,
          "en": "to event dot description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 342.48,
          "en": "With that, we're using this event data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 342.48,
          "end": 344.499,
          "en": "to prepopulate the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 344.499,
          "end": 347.7,
          "en": "and if we try to view the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 347.7,
          "end": 349.713,
          "en": "we're greeted with an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 350.73,
          "end": 352.8,
          "en": "The reason for that is that by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 352.8,
          "end": 355.47,
          "en": "when we use loader data, it searches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 355.47,
          "end": 358.8,
          "en": "for the closest available loader data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 358.8,
          "end": 361.29,
          "en": "and the highest level at which it looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 361.29,
          "end": 363.45,
          "en": "for data is the route definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.45,
          "end": 366.69,
          "en": "of the route for which this component was loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.69,
          "end": 369.36,
          "en": "So in this case, the highest level it looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 369.36,
          "end": 373.174,
          "en": "for data is this edit route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 373.174,
          "end": 377.215,
          "en": "Now we actually want loader data from this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 377.215,
          "end": 380.85,
          "en": "and to make sure that we use this loader's data instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 380.85,
          "end": 383.1,
          "en": "So the data from this parent route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 383.1,
          "end": 386.61,
          "en": "we should add a special ID property which we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 386.61,
          "end": 388.616,
          "en": "to our route definitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 388.616,
          "end": 391.138,
          "en": "And for example, name this event detail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 391.138,
          "end": 393.378,
          "en": "This ID is totally up to you though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 393.378,
          "end": 398.378,
          "en": "And then instead of using use loader data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 398.52,
          "end": 400.08,
          "en": "we use a slightly different hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 400.08,
          "end": 403.353,
          "en": "which is called Use Route loader data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 404.67,
          "end": 407.90999999999997,
          "en": "This hook works almost like use loader data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 407.90999999999997,
          "end": 411.36,
          "en": "but it takes a route ID as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 411.36,
          "end": 413.55,
          "en": "In my case here, event dash detail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 413.55,
          "end": 416.073,
          "en": "the ID I just assigned to my route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 416.90999999999997,
          "end": 418.856,
          "en": "So this ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 418.856,
          "end": 422.28,
          "en": "And I use the same hook here in edit event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 422.28,
          "end": 427.28,
          "en": "Here we use route loader data, use route loader data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.44,
          "end": 429.723,
          "en": "and use that id which we assigned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 431.4,
          "end": 435.51,
          "en": "With that you see now it loads and it populates this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 435.51,
          "end": 437.58,
          "en": "with the loaded data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 437.58,
          "end": 439.29,
